Package: Rduckvep
Title: 'DuckDB' Variant Consequence and Haplotype Annotation
Version: 2.0.0.0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sounkou Mahamane", "Toure", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com")
Description: Builds and loads the bundled 'DuckVEP' extension for 'DuckDB', which predicts the
    consequences of genomic variants on 'Ensembl' transcript models with SQL table functions.
    Variants, transcript models and results are relations. The package provides wrappers that load
    a model, annotate single variants in the manner of the 'Ensembl' Variant Effect Predictor
    ('VEP') release 116, name them in Human Genome Variation Society ('HGVS') notation, and
    predict the joint consequences of phased variants on a haplotype.
